{"seq":3,"slug":"search-strategy-diagnostics-and-practical-workflow","title":"搜索策略失效诊断与实操：预算分配、并行度与病态空间处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/hpo-search-strategy-theory/search-strategy-diagnostics-and-practical-workflow","wordCount":2278,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"搜索策略失效诊断与实操-预算分配-并行度与病态空间处理\">搜索策略失效诊断与实操：预算分配、并行度与病态空间处理</h1><p>一次超参搜索跑完，最优值只比默认配置好 0.3%、一半 trial 卡在 <code>RUNNING</code>、曲线在前 20 个 trial 就完全走平——这些都不是&quot;运气不好&quot;，而是可逐项定位的工程故障。本文不谈采样器的数学推导，只谈如何从消耗掉的资源反推它坏在哪一层，以及 2026 年主流框架（Optuna 5.0、Ray Tune 2.59）提供哪些机制去修。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把-没效果-拆成四种可区分的形态\">核心概念：把&quot;没效果&quot;拆成四种可区分的形态</h2><p>&quot;搜索没效果&quot;混合了至少四种症状，每一种的根因与处方方向相反：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>典型观测</th>\n<th>根因层</th>\n<th>主要处方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资源烧完但最优值不涨</td>\n<td><code>best_value</code> 曲线早平</td>\n<td>预算分配失配</td>\n<td>调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与 trial 数切分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行度越高效果越差</td>\n<td>串行 40 trial 优于并行 200</td>\n<td>采样器在并发下推荐重复区域</td>\n<td><code>constant_liar</code>、<code>bootstrap_count</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曲线抖动大、方差高</td>\n<td>相邻 trial 数值跳变</td>\n<td>病态搜索空间</td>\n<td>log 采样、条件参数建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trial 大量非正常结束</td>\n<td><code>FAIL</code> / <code>RUNNING</code> 占比高</td>\n<td>生命周期与存储层故障</td>\n<td>心跳、<code>max_failures</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区分点是<strong>曲线形状</strong>。<code>best_value</code> 早期锁定而仍继续跑，说明采样器无新信息可挖（常见于维度诅咒或离散空间过密）；曲线一直在动但幅度小于噪声，说明评估方差吞掉了信号，此时加 trial 的收益远小于先降评估噪声。Optuna 文档警告&quot;优化难度随参数数量大致呈指数增长&quot;，建议不要把不重要的参数放进空间——这是判断&quot;病态空间&quot;的第一条筛子（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorial/10_key_features/002_configurations.html\">Optuna: Configurations</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预算分配-试验数与单次资源的切分公式\">预算分配：试验数与单次资源的切分公式</h2><p>设单次训练最大资源为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（epoch、SGD 迭代数或样本数），缩减因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 决定每级晋级比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>，则括号数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>η</mi></msub><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{max} = \\lfloor \\log_\\eta R \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>括号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 级的分配资源为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\eta^{s+k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为最小预算。ASHA 论文报告的<strong>生产默认值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>、五个 rung、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = R/256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/256</span></span></span></span></span></strong>，默认异步 Hyperband 跑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=0,1,2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 三个括号，起始预算分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R/256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/256</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R/64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/64</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R/16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/16</span></span></span></span></span>（Li et al., <em>A System for Massively Parallel Hyperparameter Tuning</em>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.05934\">arXiv:1810.05934</a>）。</p>\n<p>一个易被忽略的耦合：<strong>括号数与 trial 数绑定</strong>。Ray Tune 文档指出 trial 少时会先填满小括号，&quot;trial 数低时早停效果会更弱&quot;，建议 <code>brackets=1</code> 作默认而非照抄论文里的 3（<a href=\"https://docs.ray.io/en/latest/tune/api/schedulers.html\">Ray Tune: Schedulers</a>）。&quot;并行度不够&quot;经常被误诊为&quot;算法不行&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[总计算预算 B] --&gt; B{预算怎么切}&#10;    B --&gt;|切给单 trial 资源 R| C[每次评估更可信&lt;br/&gt;但 trial 数少&lt;br/&gt;探索面窄]&#10;    B --&gt;|切给 trial 数 n| D[探索面广&lt;br/&gt;但单次评估噪声大]&#10;    C --&gt; E[曲线平滑&lt;br/&gt;易早平]&#10;    D --&gt; F[曲线抖动&lt;br/&gt;需更多 rung 才收敛]&#10;    E --&gt; G[诊断: 增大 n 或降低 R]&#10;    F --&gt; H[诊断: 增大 R 或抬高最小预算]\">graph TD\n    A[总计算预算 B] --&gt; B{预算怎么切}\n    B --&gt;|切给单 trial 资源 R| C[每次评估更可信&lt;br/&gt;但 trial 数少&lt;br/&gt;探索面窄]\n    B --&gt;|切给 trial 数 n| D[探索面广&lt;br/&gt;但单次评估噪声大]\n    C --&gt; E[曲线平滑&lt;br/&gt;易早平]\n    D --&gt; F[曲线抖动&lt;br/&gt;需更多 rung 才收敛]\n    E --&gt; G[诊断: 增大 n 或降低 R]\n    F --&gt; H[诊断: 增大 R 或抬高最小预算]</pre><p>判断切分是否合理的信号是<strong>剪枝率</strong>。Optuna 官方示例中，20 个 trial 用 <code>MedianPruner</code> 有 14 个被剪掉（70%）（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorial/10_key_features/003_efficient_optimization_algorithms.html\">Optuna: Efficient Optimization Algorithms</a>）。剪枝率长期低于 20% 说明 rung 太粗或早停信号与最终目标相关性弱；高于 90% 说明最小预算太小、评估在噪声里做决策。<code>SuccessiveHalvingPruner</code> 的 <code>bootstrap_count</code>（默认 0）要求某个 rung 先完成若干 trial 才开始晋级判定（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/generated/optuna.pruners.SuccessiveHalvingPruner.html\">Optuna: SuccessiveHalvingPruner</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行度-为什么并行会稀释你的搜索\">并行度：为什么并行会稀释你的搜索</h2><p>并行本身不会让算法变差，但它破坏贝叶斯类方法的前提——<strong>采样器读取到的最新结果</strong>。4 个 worker 同时启动时，第 2~4 个看到的仍是同一批已完成 trial，TPE 便重复推荐相近区域，这就是并行下的&quot;重复采样&quot;退化。</p>\n<p><code>TPESampler</code> 默认以 <code>constant_liar=True</code> 应对，作用是&quot;惩罚仍在运行中的 trial 附近的参数配置&quot;，避免并行 worker 建议到邻近配置；<code>n_startup_trials=10</code> 表示前 10 个 trial 随机采样，<code>multivariate=True</code>（单目标默认开启）建模参数间相关性（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/samplers/generated/optuna.samplers.TPESampler.html\">Optuna: TPESampler</a>）。</p>\n<p>并行还引入<strong>长尾 worker 问题</strong>。ASHA 论文第二个 CIFAR-10 基准上，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 预算下训练时间均值 30 分钟、标准差 27 分钟，这种高方差正是同步 Successive Halving 落后的原因；ASHA 通过异步晋级在 25 worker 上取得约 10× 加速（另一任务约 28×）（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.05934\">arXiv:1810.05934</a>）。Ray Tune 也把 ASHA 的优势归结为&quot;更好的并行性、并在淘汰期间避免 straggler 问题&quot;。</p>\n<p>存储层是并行的第二个隐性瓶颈。单进程多线程用 <code>InMemoryStorage</code> + <code>n_jobs</code>（GIL 下纯 Python 不受益）；单机多进程用 <code>JournalStorage</code> 或 <code>RDBStorage</code>——SQLite 不适合并行，缺 <code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code>、易 <code>database is locked</code>、不支持 NFS；多机用 <code>RDBStorage</code>（PostgreSQL / MySQL），跨节点不要用 journal 文件，因其锁在共享文件系统上不可靠；数千节点时在 worker 与 RDB 间加 <code>GrpcStorageProxy</code>（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorial/10_key_features/004_distributed.html\">Optuna: 分布式</a>）。并行与分布式存在&quot;固有非确定性&quot;，要复现必须串行执行并给采样器设种子。诊断口诀：&quot;多 worker 同时启动 → 推荐邻近配置 → 重复探索&quot;，处方即 <code>constant_liar=True</code> 或 <code>bootstrap_count&gt;0</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"病态空间-三类最常被忽略的失真\">病态空间：三类最常被忽略的失真</h2><p>空间写法错误往往不报错，只让 study 悄悄低效。三类高频问题：</p>\n<p><strong>尺度失真。</strong> 学习率、通道数这类跨多个数量级的参数若线性均匀采样，采样点挤在大值端，小值区几乎被跳过。规则是：跨数量级用 <code>log=True</code>，取值范围窄且有绝对意义（如 0.0–1.0 的 dropout 率）才用线性采样，取值必须离散时用 <code>step</code> 约束以缩小空间（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorial/10_key_features/002_configurations.html\">Optuna: Configurations</a>）。判据：把建议值画成直方图，分布与先验不符就是尺度写错。</p>\n<p><strong>条件分支未建模。</strong> 某参数只在另一参数取特定值时才有意义（如&quot;仅当优化器是 Adam 时才有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&quot;），若无条件放进空间，会有一批 trial 的该参数完全不影响结果，稀释重要性估计。正确做法是 <code>suggest_categorical</code> 配合 <code>if</code> 分支，让不相关参数根本不被建议；这类空间用 <code>TPESampler(group=True)</code>（须与 <code>multivariate=True</code> 同用）按子空间分解并联合采样（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/samplers/generated/optuna.samplers.TPESampler.html\">Optuna: TPESampler</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>离散空间过密。</strong> 把连续参数强转成大量离散档位，会让 TPE 的核密度估计被阶梯化，配置看似相邻实则跳变——这是&quot;曲线一直抖但不收敛&quot;的常见根因，处方是减少档位或改回连续采样。</p>\n<p>这不意味着&quot;越复杂的采样器越好&quot;：一项以隐藏目标函数排名的竞赛中贝叶斯优化优于随机搜索（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.10201\">arXiv:2104.10201</a>），但 Optuna 选型表指出并行资源充足且含类别/条件参数时，随机搜索或遗传算法同样合理。空间病态到采样器无法建模时，退回随机搜索反而更诚实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实操巡检清单-从-trial-状态反推故障\">实操巡检清单：从 trial 状态反推故障</h2><p>诊断应基于状态数据。Optuna 中未捕获的异常把 trial 标记为 <code>FAIL</code>，且默认中止整个 study（需向 <code>optimize()</code> 的 <code>catch</code> 传异常类型才会继续）；返回 <code>float(&quot;nan&quot;)</code> 同样标记 <code>FAIL</code> 但不中止。僵尸 trial 有两条路径：给 <code>RDBStorage</code> 配 <code>heartbeat_interval</code> 与 <code>grace_period</code>，超时 <code>RUNNING</code> 自动转 <code>FAIL</code>；或用 <code>ask()</code>/<code>tell()</code> 时自行 <code>study.tell(t, state=TrialState.FAIL)</code>（<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/faq.html\">Optuna: FAQ</a>）。Ray Tune 侧对应 <code>tune.FailureConfig(max_failures=N)</code>：节点故障时其上所有 trial 都被重调度，但<strong>只有 trainable 实现 checkpoint 保存/加载时重试才保留进度</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.ray.io/en/latest/tune/tutorials/tune-fault-tolerance.html\">Ray Tune: Fault Tolerance</a>）。</p>\n<p>按顺序检查六项即可覆盖绝大多数失效：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>trial 状态分布</strong>——<code>study.trials_dataframe()</code> 统计 <code>COMPLETE</code> / <code>PRUNED</code> / <code>FAIL</code> / <code>RUNNING</code> 占比，先排除僵尸。</li>\n<li><strong>剪枝率</strong>——明显偏离基准即回头调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>best_value</code> 曲线形状</strong>——早平→加探索面或减少参数；持续抖动→查评估方差与空间离散化。</li>\n<li><strong>并行度敏感性</strong>——同一 study 串行与并行的前 40 个 trial 对比，若并行明显更差，检查 <code>constant_liar</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>参数建议值分布</strong>——直方图核对 log/linear 尺度。</li>\n<li><strong>重复参数组</strong>——在目标函数内检查历史已完成 trial，命中则直接返回存储值。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>框架本身不带&quot;该用多少 trial&quot;的规则：Optuna 的 <code>n_trials=20</code>、每 RDB worker 100 trial 都是演示设置；Ray Tune 建议 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\geq 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 是合理量级。真正的停止点来自你自己的&quot;最优值-成本&quot;曲线：边际提升低于评估噪声时，停止即最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>先分型再开方</strong>：预算失配、并行稀释、空间病态、生命周期故障四类根因，处方方向互不相同。</li>\n<li><strong>预算是切分题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>η</mi></msub><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{max}=\\lfloor\\log_\\eta R\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>，ASHA 生产默认为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>、五 rung、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=R/256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/256</span></span></span></span></span>；括号数与 trial 数绑定，trial 少时早停自然弱。</li>\n<li><strong>剪枝率是温度计</strong>：过低说明 rung 粗，过高说明最小预算进了噪声区；<code>bootstrap_count</code> 避免用一两个样本做淘汰决定。</li>\n<li><strong>并行会稀释采样信息</strong>：<code>constant_liar=True</code> 惩罚运行中 trial 附近的建议，<code>multivariate</code>/<code>group</code> 处理参数相关性与条件空间。</li>\n<li><strong>空间失真不会报错</strong>：尺度用 log、条件参数用分支建模、避免离散过密；参数越多优化难度近似指数上升。</li>\n<li><strong>巡检靠状态数据</strong>：状态分布、剪枝率、<code>best_value</code> 曲线、参数直方图逐项排查；框架不给预算规则，停止点是边际提升低于评估噪声。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同章节的 <a href=\"hyperparameter-space-and-search-budget-modeling\">搜索空间与预算建模</a> 给出正面建模，<a href=\"sampling-strategies-random-grid-quasi-monte-carlo\">采样策略</a> 讨论均匀性更好的替代采样；本文只补充&quot;已经跑坏了怎么查&quot;的诊断视角。</p>\n<h2 id=\"来源\">来源</h2><ul>\n<li>Li et al., <em>A System for Massively Parallel Hyperparameter Tuning</em> (ASHA)，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.05934\">arXiv:1810.05934</a>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>、rung、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=R/256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/256</span></span></span></span></span> 与加速数据）。</li>\n<li>Optuna 文档：<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorial/10_key_features/002_configurations.html\">Configurations</a>、<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorial/10_key_features/003_efficient_optimization_algorithms.html\">Efficient Optimization Algorithms</a>、<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorial/10_key_features/004_distributed.html\">Distributed optimization</a>、<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/faq.html\">FAQ</a>、<a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/samplers/generated/optuna.samplers.TPESampler.html\">TPESampler</a>。</li>\n<li>Ray Tune 文档：<a href=\"https://docs.ray.io/en/latest/tune/api/schedulers.html\">Schedulers</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.ray.io/en/latest/tune/tutorials/tune-fault-tolerance.html\">Fault Tolerance</a>。</li>\n<li>采样器对比 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.10201\">arXiv:2104.10201</a>；版本 <a href=\"https://pypi.org/pypi/optuna/json\">PyPI: optuna</a>（5.0.0）、<a href=\"https://pypi.org/pypi/ray/json\">PyPI: ray</a>（2.59.0）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"搜索策略失效诊断与实操：预算分配、并行度与病态空间处理","id":"搜索策略失效诊断与实操-预算分配-并行度与病态空间处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把\"没效果\"拆成四种可区分的形态","id":"核心概念-把-没效果-拆成四种可区分的形态"},{"level":2,"text":"预算分配：试验数与单次资源的切分公式","id":"预算分配-试验数与单次资源的切分公式"},{"level":2,"text":"并行度：为什么并行会稀释你的搜索","id":"并行度-为什么并行会稀释你的搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"病态空间：三类最常被忽略的失真","id":"病态空间-三类最常被忽略的失真"},{"level":2,"text":"实操巡检清单：从 trial 状态反推故障","id":"实操巡检清单-从-trial-状态反推故障"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"来源","id":"来源"}],"prev":{"title":"采样策略机制：随机、网格、拉丁超立方与 Sobol 准蒙特卡洛对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/hpo-search-strategy-theory/sampling-strategies-random-grid-quasi-monte-carlo"},"next":{"title":"高斯过程代理模型与采集函数：EI/UCB/PI 的探索-利用权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/bayesian-optimization-surrogate/gaussian-process-surrogate-and-acquisition-functions"}}